<title>POLAND: Beton Stal buys stakes in two firms.</title>
<headline>Beton Stal buys stakes in two firms.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Beton Stal SA has bought minority stakes in two companies formed from state-owned tourist agency Orbis SA, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said it had bought 26.6 percent of Orbis Transport Sp.z.o.o. and 25.1 percent of PBP Orbis on December 31 from International Business Management Sp.z. o.o..</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
